Imide-Hypervalent Iodines(III) from Iodoarenes
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Moriyama, Katsuhiko; Ishida, Kazuma; Togo, Hideo
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2012), 14(3), 946-949

